- New `testEqualsAndHashCodeAcrossNumberTypes` asserts equal-implies-equal-hashcode across `Integer`/`LazilyParsedNumber`/`Double`/`BigDecimal`/`BigInteger`, the JSON round-trip case from the issue, `-0.0` vs

